      "Fixed the design loader silently rewriting authored values as it loaded them, changing 10,495 values across 580 of 735 library files, because `ValueClamp` range tables built to shape a slider were being used to rewrite shipped data in place with no undo.",
      "Measured the rewrite by field: speed 6283, bps 3883, knockback 117, `bulletDamage` 105 (every healer in the library), aspect 28, projectile size 25, `tankShieldRegen` 23, `fov` 21, `tankHP` 5, `tankBodyDamage` 2, `tankSides` 2 and `tankShieldCapacity` 1.",
      "Fixed the sanitizer destroying Shotgun's `speed: -5`, a deliberate stationary round named in a live comment on `_aimGunCanFire`, where `speed` is an offset and launch speed is `speed` plus 5, so the old floor of 1 turned every trap and pillbox in the library into a fast moving round.",
      "Changed the loader to apply hard bounds only, where every entry not marked free names a consumer that genuinely breaks with a crash, hang, NaN, unbounded allocation or infinite loop, and a field with no such consumer gets a finiteness test and nothing else.",
