      "Fixed a negative speed reaching `Math.sqrt` at eight recoil sites, whose NaN the animator's guard reads as false, so recoil had been dying silently on the 1741 turrets that carry one.",
      "Added the `CLAMP01_HARD_BOUNDS` switch, which restores the range half alone, with notes saying plainly that this state is worse than either endpoint and exists for bisecting rather than resting at.",
      "Fixed healers draining their own team, because a healer's `bulletDamage` is stored negative from the healer gun preset at damage -1, the only one of the 104 gun presets below zero, and both heal sites read `healAmt = b.damage` raw.",
      "Fixed every migrated healer in the library having been inert before that, since the old loader clamped the negative to 0, leaving them useless but harmless.",
