      "Fixed the component furthest from the user winning an Escape press, because capture phase listeners run outermost first and the modal bound its listener on `window` while the dropdown bound on `document`.",
      "Added `components/shared/escapeStack.ts`, which installs a single window capture listener lazily while anything is dismissible and sends the key to the last owner pushed, where it stops.",
