      "Measured on the squeeze test map: a jailed bot that never escaped in 90 seconds now exits through the near exact door in 3.4 seconds with zero false learning, and a bot standing at an exact fit door crosses in 3.2 seconds instead of never.",
      "Changed target acquisition to refuse anything a bot cannot actually reach or hit, testing every candidate against the exact navigation graph for reach with the body, or against the bot's own smallest bullet radius for a shot through a gap.",
