      "Measured that endless evict and rebuild loop eating the builder's entire 3ms budget inside the enemy logic slice: 3.85ms average, 1187 rebuilds per minute and roughly 1MB per second of typed array garbage, with collection dips down to 150 FPS.",
      "Changed `EXACT_GRID_MAX` from 8 to 40, made eviction take only grids idle for 30 seconds or more, dropped demand and failed open when the cap is reached with nothing idle, and made the cache stamps wall clock milliseconds read once per builder call.",
