      "Changed stuck escape scanning to probe at quarter cell steps so that a partial exit wins before the body blind lenient ray does, which clears up the long red and magenta probe stretches seen at corners.",
      "Changed follows that target the player on wall only maps to route through the committed path system as well, using a field keyed by `playerId` and shared with bots fleeing the player.",
      "Made the clearance margin app wide, so pursuit and roaming waypoint marches now prefer R plus 10 units of clearance and fall back to exact R, fixing corner grazing, which gets worse the larger the body.",
      "Made steering body aware, so escape rays now see tank bodies, colocated bots break ray symmetry per bot, and follow and flee steering arcs around blocking tank bodies while exempting the target being pursued.",
