      "Measured escape claims falling from 23% to 0.1%, body contacts from 854 to 416 per run, and catch rate rising from 63% to 75%.",
      "Changed bots to think farm first, with the same decision applied when the target is the player, so an Enemy tank weighs up whether you are worth fighting instead of attacking on sight.",
