      "Ran the simulation behind a 30fps `requestAnimationFrame` gate with a DPR cap of 2, zero per frame allocation, a reduced motion opt out and full teardown.",
      "Added a quality ladder that degrades on a simulation only cost moving average, where rebuilds resample the old field so the smoke is never wiped by a tier change or a resize.",
