      "Skipped `isFading` turretted bullets in `_emit3PhaseTurrettedBullets` across all 3 phases, so they no longer go through the per part alpha path at all.",
      "Added a new `_drawDyingTurrettedBulletsAsUnits()` helper that, for each dying minion, first composites the accumulated buffer to the 2D `ctx`.",
