      "Added a `bornOutsideMap` flag on `Bullet`, set to true at the sub turret and auto turret spawn sites whenever the muzzle lands outside the map limit.",
      "Changed the hard clamp to be skipped while that flag is set, with the existing spring force still pulling the projectile back so drones ride back onto the map, and the flag clearing once both axes are within the soft border.",
      "Added a 5 second safety kill that recycles any projectile whose controller fights the return forever.",
      "Left `computeBorderForce`, `BORDER_FORCE_K`, `BORDER_DAMP` and `BORDER_MAX_PEN` untouched, so the physics and the inside map feel are byte identical.",
      "Fixed traps fired with the `goToTarget` behavior, meaning Builder, Constructor and Engineer, misbehaving when aimed at off map cursor positions, where they rolled along the border, spun in place and showed jerky speed stutter.",
      "Fixed the first of two causes, a speed floor in `controllerGoToTarget` that restored velocity to `initialSpeed` whenever friction or border damping reduced it, so the border could never actually slow the trap down.",
      "Fixed the second, a velocity overwrite in the `softCollisionTrap` branch of `applyControllerOutput` which replaced velocity every frame with goal direction velocity at full speed and erased the border's inward push.",
      "Fixed both with a conditional yield plus a permanent disable on return, built on a new `_borderTouched` flag on `Bullet` that defaults to false and resets in pool init and pull.",
      "Plumbed `mapLimit` through `executeControllers` into `applyControllerOutput` and `controllerGoToTarget` so both can see where the border is.",
      "Changed `controllerGoToTarget` to skip the speed floor whenever the trap is past `_bBorder` or has already touched the border, so the border spring and the motor trap friction of roughly 6 percent per frame can genuinely decelerate and reverse it.",
      "Changed the `softCollisionTrap` branch so a trap past `_bBorder` sets `_borderTouched` to true and skips the velocity overwrite entirely.",
      "Changed a trap back inside `_bBorder` with `_borderTouched` set to have `orbitTimer` set to -1, permanently disabling the controller for that trap and clearing the flag, so friction settles the remaining momentum smoothly.",
      "Changed the result so the trap moves smoothly outward, crosses the border, gets pulled back by the existing spring force and settles.",
      "Kept in map behavior of every `goToTarget` tank byte identical, since the new logic is gated entirely on the position being past `_bBorder` or on the touched once flag.",
      "Fixed body layers with `useInheritColor` set to false rendering their hardcoded design colour in team based modes and in team context tank previews, even when the renderer was in a forced colour context.",
