      "Checked that wording against the hardcoded 20% safety net in `GameLogic.ts` and the heat thresholds that flee at 75 and force a flee at 80.",
      "Made the Flee HP Threshold authoritative, so when a category sets it at all, including at 0, the hardcoded 20% safety net is suppressed for that enemy.",
      "Fixed three problems that forced it: the 0% default did not match engine behavior, slider 0 did not actually mean never flee, and any value under 20 could never make a tank flee later than 20% because the safety net always fired first.",
