      "Shipped the first prebuilt category, Offensive Tanks, wired into the initial game state so it is there in every fresh session, carrying a stable id and a creation timestamp of 0 to keep the defaults at the top of the sorted list.",
      "Added 46 deduplicated tanks to Offensive Tanks at distance 50, with autoshoot and autospin off, keep attacking through cover off, aimbot 25 and flee threshold 20.",
      "Set its priorities with bullet health, penetration, damage and reload at tier 1, body damage, max health, bullet speed and movement at tier 2, and shield regen and capacity at tier 3, with fill remaining randomly on.",
