      "Set Old Dreadnoughts to `growthFixedSpRate` true and `growthLevelsPerSp` 6, which together with the basic tank's 42 point bonus lands max skills, 90 points across 10 stats at a cap of 9 each, at level 288.",
      "Added an exported `expectedSpFromLeveling(level, gm, maxSP)` helper returning the cumulative skill points earned from leveling 0 up to a given level, excluding the starting bonus, and routed `addXp`, `addEnemyXp`, `setLevel` and the edit stats popup through it.",
      "Routed the `addXp` growth branch through the fixed rate when the toggle is on, leaving it on the existing curve otherwise.",
      "Fixed `setLevel`, which used `Math.min(level, maxSkillPoints)`, so setting level 60 in Old Dreadnoughts granted 42 points and level 300 gave exactly the same, where it now grants 10 at level 60 and 50 at level 300.",
      "Mirrored the fixed rate branch into `addEnemyXp` so bots organically gaining XP in Old Dreadnoughts level up on the same 1 per N cadence as the player.",
      "Changed `handleLevelChange` in `components/EditPlayerStatsPopup.tsx` to use `expectedSpFromLeveling` so the slider's displayed skill point delta matches the real game mode rule for both player and enemy editing.",
