      "Lifted `EDGE_MARGIN` and `outsidePlayfield` to function scope, just before the rocks block, so they exist whether or not rocks are enabled and rocks and portals share one margin definition.",
      "Restored the Old Dreadnoughts Maze and Forge areas to working order with the new portal placement fully preserved, including the NORMAL tile filter, the tiered fallback, and the edge, wall, rock and inter portal checks.",
      "Gave all three Old Dreadnoughts areas (Main, Maze and Forge) `portalTimings` on both portals, tuned so the pacing feels right: `appearDuration` 45000, `disappearDuration` 30000, `initialDelay` 10000.",
      "Fixed the root cause of the portal timing, that `updateTimedPortals` and `updatePortalVisuals` ran every frame in editor mode, ticking `initialDelay` down while the user sat in the Map Designer.",
