      "Added a defensive `resetTimedPortalRuntime` helper, called from `enterTestMode`, which resets `_timedPhaseStart`, `_spawnTime`, `_dying`, `_particlesDraining` and `_deathTime`, then reapplies the original `initialDelay` and durations from `mapConfig.portalTimings`.",
      "Fixed a second Play after the first skipping the initial delay, since `updateTimedPortals` permanently consumes `initialDelay` by setting it to 0 on first activation.",
