      "Kept cell size at 150u, so wall, rock and spawn zone density is unchanged and the arena is simply bigger, with `computeAreaLayout` recomputing the Maze and Forge offsets automatically.",
      "Fixed a dread bullet colour mismatch in the `GameCanvas.tsx` prepass, where the bullet team colour override was forcing every player bullet to the team colour in Old Dreadnoughts while the player body in that mode uses `tankColor`.",
      "Fixed the reported symptom, that after evolving into a dread the body switched to the dread mint `#7adbba` but the bullets stayed team blue.",
      "Added `_playerBulletTeamOverride`, which is `_isTDM2` and not Old Dreadnoughts, gating the player and player TAP overrides on it so player bullets follow `state.tankColor` and match the body across every evolution.",
      "Left bot bullets still team coloured through the Team1 to Team4 `ownerBehavior` branch, so friend and foe identification in Main TDM is preserved.",
      "Fixed a tank conversion downgrade in the cross area portal teleport block, where the old check fired `evolveToTank` in both directions whenever the current tree root differed from the destination's wanted root.",
      "Fixed a dread player teleporting to Main or Maze, whose `startingTankFileName` is basic, being force converted back to basic, which defeated the whole point of evolving in the Forge.",
      "Added a `_wantedRoot !== 'basic'` guard so force conversion only fires when the destination demands a non basic tree, since areas whose starting tank is basic are entry point defaults and must never downgrade an already evolved player.",
      "Mirrored the bot teleport logic, which was already one way and only ever converts to dread, never back, so the player path now matches it.",
      "Verified all four cases: basic into Forge evolves to base dread, dread into Forge is skipped, dread into Main or Maze is now skipped so the dread is kept, and basic into Main or Maze is skipped.",
      "Fixed auto fire and auto spin breaking the spawn grace period after a portal teleport, since `state.autoFire` and `state.autoSpin` stayed on so the spawn animation started its grace period god mode and the player immediately fired.",
      "Zeroed `state.autoFire` and `state.autoSpin` at the very top of the teleport branch, before the spawn position is set and before grace starts, since previously a portal teleport granted roughly 0 ms of effective grace with auto fire on.",
      "Changed Old Dreadnoughts to a three team setup, blue as Team1, red as Team2 and dread as Team3, so dreads can damage blue and red, blue and red can damage dreads, and dreads cannot damage other dreads.",
