      "Fixed snap placement not auto enabling when a tank or a projectile is loaded, following the same active sides rule the editor uses everywhere else.",
      "Fixed the root cause, that `loadTankConfig` was forcing `snapPlacement` straight from the saved config, or to false when the config had none, which bypassed the auto snap `useEffect` entirely.",
      "Fixed the `useEffect` being unable to always correct that afterwards, because its `_autoSnapActiveSides` dependency does not change when the loaded tank's `tankSides` happens to equal the previous active layer's sides.",
      "Changed snap to be computed directly from the loaded tank's `tankSides`, mirroring the `useEffect` rule that 3 or more sides turns snapping on.",
      "Fixed both the Tank Library and the Projectile Library load paths with that change.",
      "Fixed a longstanding bug where picking a turret on a body layer and then cancelling Select from Canvas produced a preview that was missized, mispositioned, and hidden inside the body polygon.",
      "Fixed that same broken state contaminating the editor across layer switches and tank loads, so five sub fixes shipped together, each one a precondition for the next.",
      "Changed editor state in `editingTurret` to hold the original placement values rather than the already baked stored values, which is what made the preview disagree with the turret you picked.",
      "Added `_origLength`, `_origWidth`, `_origXOffset` and `_origYOffset` to `Turret` to carry those originals.",
      "Captured the originals at `placeTurret` and `placePresetFromPreview`, before the placement transforms are applied, with the pick paths reading them directly.",
      "Migrated old saved tanks that have no original fields lazily on `loadTankConfig`, deriving the values back out with inverse math.",
      "Changed `loadTankConfig` to also reset `state.editingTurret` to defaults, so editor contamination can no longer migrate across tank loads.",
      "Changed live editing a selected turret to rebake the slider value before mirroring it into the stored `Turret`, so the original and the baked value stay consistent.",
      "Changed cancelling to preserve `xOffset` and `yOffset` when a turret was actively picked, so `editingTurret` keeps that turret's radial distance.",
      "Changed the `applyLayerShift` step in both `placeTurret` and `drawPreviewTurret` to always rotate to `defaultAngle`, the mouse snap angle, when working out the placement position.",
      "Set magnitude to the radius plus `layerShift` and direction to the mouse direction, so the preview tracks the picked turret's appearance while still snapping to each flat side midpoint as the mouse moves.",
      "Made the same change in the preview and in the placement, so what you see is exactly what gets placed.",
      "Restored round trip exactness in `_inverseW18Position`, which was missing a divide by scale, since the baked radius is the original radius times scale plus `layerShift`.",
      "Removed the width fit `kWidth` clamp from `placeTurret` along with the matching clamp in `drawPreviewTurret`.",
      "Removed a clamp that silently shrank any width above 90% of a body layer's flat side, which broke the principle that every dimension change must be reflected in the values you set.",
