      "Changed snap placement to resync on every layer entry and every sides change, not only on the one circle to polygon transition it used to watch, so a polygon layer turns snap on and a circle turns it off.",
      "Removed the sentinel based initial mount skip, so a session that starts on a triangle has snap placement on from the first frame instead of waiting for a transition.",
      "Fixed combo placement disabling snap, since the post combo reset cleared both snap and compass, and with no sides change to refire the sync snap stayed off until it was turned back on by hand.",
      "Fixed library preset placement overwriting the turret you were editing, since placing a preset reseeded `state.editingTurret` from the piece just placed, so picking a sniper preset left the editor showing a sniper like configuration.",
