      "Changed fleeing bots to record `fleeSourceId` the moment fear triggers, clear it when fear resets, update it from the bot that attacked them or from the player, and aim at that real source with field of view gating and predictive aim.",
      "Changed flee direction to be validated against walls, replacing the old avoidance blend, with the dead end override applied too so a panicking bot is not driven further into a pocket.",
