      "Made attacking bots dead end aware, so the combat hold breaks and `retreatUntil` clears when the chosen direction leads deeper into a dead end, with the retreat trigger getting the same override.",
      "Removed the retreat trigger suppression, which had been blocking retreats in ordinary corridors.",
      "Extended `validateCombatDirectionWalls` with escape direction parameters, giving it a dead end escape fallback, and passed those escape directions in at both the retreat trigger and the combat hold calculation.",
      "Polished the following state so it computes the real distance to the target, checks line of sight every 4 frames when close, and no longer freezes its aim when standing still.",
      "Changed line of sight hysteresis to apply to every target type rather than the player alone, and doubled it near walls.",
      "Added the new tuning values to the enemy behaviour constants in `types.ts`: heat decay rate, damage scale, flee threshold, force flee threshold, distance scale, retreat scale, rush suppression and cornered range, plus `DEAD_END_ESCAPE_DEPTH`.",
