      "Replaced the random ray stuck escape with a fixed 8 direction cardinal scan, which is guaranteed to line up with axis aligned maze corridors where a random ray was only ever hoping to find one.",
      "Rewrote `calculateRoamTarget` around 8 evenly spaced rays with half cell steps and a quarter cell fallback, so the function always returns a walkable target.",
      "Fixed wall look ahead overshoot, so the probe now only runs when the target is farther away than the probe distance, which stops enemies constantly repicking a target while inside a corridor.",
