      "Added `snapDirectionTo8Way()` so movement lands on one of 8 cardinal and diagonal directions, the same as a two key WASD input, with a 70% diagonal bias during combat when the enemy is not retreating.",
      "Unified all enemy acceleration to 0.11, matching the player, across attacking, fleeing, following and targeting shapes."
