      "Added `fireBulletAutoSubTurret()` so auto turret circles mounted on a bullet can carry multi barrel sub turrets of their own, each with independent firing timing, recoil springs and controllers.",
      "Changed a bullet's `autoSubTurrets` to be deep cloned at spawn through `_cloneSubTurrets()`, so bullets from one design no longer share a single mutable set of sub turrets.",
