      "Added sub turret `animProgress` and recoil spring decay stepping inside the bullet update loop, so sub turrets riding a flying projectile animate and let their recoil settle.",
      "Added the auto turret sub turret extent to the scratch canvas bounds, so a projectile carrying sub turrets is measured at its true extent.",
      "Cut around 370 per frame allocations out of the hottest paths: `roundedBarrelPath` now writes into module level `Float64Array` buffers, nine sites that spread an array before sorting it moved onto the existing `_sortLayers()` helper, and `savedRd` became plain scalar locals.",
      "Converted four more allocating helpers to write into reusable objects, where `springDampedRotationInto` and `springDampedTurretAimInto` fill a shared output object, `shouldTriggerFearInto` uses a module level result, and the enemy state decision helper writes into a shared result with an aliasing safe copy.",
      "Removed per frame closure allocations from the render paths, replacing five redundant `mapVal` closure definitions with a single module level `_mapVal()` and dropping eight unused imports of allocating enemy behaviour functions from `GameLogic.ts`.",
      "Changed bullet against player collision to swept circle to circle continuous detection, matching the bullet against enemy and bullet against shape checks, so fast projectiles can no longer tunnel through the player at low frame rates or high velocity.",
      "Added cell array recycling pools to `SpatialHash` and `CombatSpatialHash`, removing another set of per frame array allocations from collision lookups.",
      "Extended the rotating start index pattern to shape against shape, stepping by the prime 83, and bullet against shape, stepping by 71, both chosen to differ from the existing bullet against bullet step of 97 so dense clusters no longer favour whichever entity is iterated first.",
      "Added three debug only visibility toggles to the pause menu, Shape HP/Shield, Projectile HP and AI Logic Overlay, all defaulting to on, each gating its own drawing across shape HP text, projectile HP text on both the OffscreenCanvas and Canvas2D paths, and the enemy logic overlays.",
      "Fixed two edge cases around dying enemies: the enemy lookup map `_enemyById` no longer includes an enemy that has started dying, and the bullet against enemy loop breaks early the moment an enemy enters its `isDying` state.",
