      "Added a purple animated arrow that points at the selected turret's muzzle, in every editing context.",
      "Upgraded turret hit detection from a circle test that took the first match to an oriented bounding box test that takes the closest match, with no new allocations.",
      "Changed select mode to turn itself off automatically when the last turret is deleted, in any context.",
      "Added a per turret render layer slider to the turret manager, the Projectile Designer and the auto sub turret panels."
